      "description": "Build, read and audit a Latent Semantic Indexing index over a declared prose graph — a library, the skills, the beans, docs — to find units that discuss the same thing in different words, near-duplicates, outlier clusters, and a proposed home for unfiled work. Every output is a proposal; LSI never writes a relation.",
